    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Export: every rejected record, full detail (CSV)",
      "description": "Every rejected record across BOTH engines -- no 60-row cap, no truncated reason text. Built specifically to export and work through by hand: click this panel's menu (hover the title, click the \u22ee that appears top-right) \u2192 Inspect \u2192 Data \u2192 Download CSV. Columns: order_id + line_no locate the exact line; sku/qty/unit_price/currency are the offending values as originally submitted; source_file is which landed batch it came from; 'NiFi says'/'SSIS says'/agree are each engine's verdict; reason is the full, untruncated rejection detail.",
